  readonly a; b; c; d; e; f;
}
```

mergeClosureState needs a,b,c,d (with c continuing a or x), nestedMergeState needs a,b,c,d,e,f (c merged from e,f), phases conflict fixture needs a,b,b2,c,d, b.test mixed needs a,b,c,d,e.

